was killed by ochre jelly acid.

Moral to the story: don't melee jellies. They hit hard.  Since they're
slow, there's usually no good reason to fight one in melee.

2)  Incredibly powerful wizard goes through a trap door and winds up on
level 24. Working his way back upstairs,  he meets Medusa waiting at
